The next-generation Apple TV 4K will ship with an upgraded Siri Remote, according to previously discovered <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/08/18/new-apple-tv-siri-remote-leak/">macOS 26.7 code findings</a>. We don't know what those upgrades will be, but these two new Remote app features could hint at what's to come. The new Apple TV 4K is likely to be unveiled later this month or in October.<br/>
<br/>
